    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43138" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scrūtātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		scrutor, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a searching</i>, <i>examining</i>,
				<i>investigating</i> (post-Aug. and very rare).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">domus,</span>”
				<i>a searching</i>, <i>search</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Vit. Beat. 23</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insulsa nimis et odiosa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					9, 10, 5</span></i>
			; Oros. praef. p. 5. 
			</div>
